#: .\templates\privacy\privacy_policy.html:19
msgid ""
"We respect your privacy. We will not sell or share your personal details, "
"including your name, your date of birth, your email address and your "
"password. Messages you send to people on Speedy Net are personal and will "
"not be shared with other people or websites. Your password is saved "
"encrypted on our database."
msgstr ""
"Respectem la teva privadesa. No vendrem ni compartirem les teves dades "
"personals, com ara el teu nom, la teva data de naixement, la teva adreça de "
"correu electrònic i la teva contrasenya. Els missatges que envieu a persones"
" a Speedy Net són personals i no es compartiran amb altres persones o llocs "
"web. La vostra contrasenya es desa xifrada a la nostra base de dades."

#: .\templates\privacy\privacy_policy.html:21
msgid ""
"Your profile on Speedy Net is visible to everyone, but you can choose who to"
" share with your email address and your date of birth. If you signed up for "
"Speedy Match, your Speedy Match profile will only be visible to people who "
"match you according to the settings you have set up on the site, and that "
"you match them according to their settings. Your profile on Speedy Match "
"will not appear on Google and is not visible to people who are not "
"registered to the site."
msgstr ""
"El teu perfil a Speedy Net és visible per a tothom, però pots triar qui "
"compartir amb la teva adreça de correu electrònic i la teva data de "
"naixement. Si us heu registrat a Speedy Match, el vostre perfil de Speedy "
"Match només serà visible per a les persones que us coincideixin segons la "
"configuració que hàgiu configurat al lloc i que els coincideixis segons la "
"seva configuració. El teu perfil a Speedy Match no apareixerà a Google i no "
"serà visible per a les persones que no estiguin registrades al lloc."

#: .\templates\privacy\privacy_policy.html:23
msgid ""
"If you have deactivated your account on Speedy Net or Speedy Match, your "
"profile on that site will be removed from the site and you will not appear "
"in other people's search results on the site. Note that deactivating your "
"account on Speedy Net also automatically deactivates your account at Speedy "
"Match. You can deactivate only your account at Speedy Match, in which case "
"your Speedy Net account will remain active. You can reactivate your account "
"after you deactivate it whenever you like."
msgstr ""
"Si heu desactivat el vostre compte a Speedy Net o Speedy Match, el vostre "
"perfil d'aquest lloc s'eliminarà del lloc i no apareixerà als resultats de "
"cerca d'altres persones al lloc. Tingueu en compte que la desactivació del "
"vostre compte a Speedy Net també desactiva automàticament el vostre compte a"
" Speedy Match. Només pots desactivar el teu compte a Speedy Match, en aquest"
" cas el teu compte Speedy Net romandrà actiu. Podeu reactivar el vostre "
"compte després de desactivar-lo quan vulgueu."

#: .\templates\privacy\privacy_policy.html:25
msgid ""
"If you want, you can delete your account on Speedy Net. Deleting your Speedy"
" Net account will automatically delete your Speedy Match account as well. To"
" delete your Speedy Net account, log in to Speedy Net, deactivate your "
"account, and then click “Delete Account” (in the “Edit Profile” menu). Fill "
"out the details in the form and confirm. Please note that a deleted account "
"cannot be recovered. Account deletion is permanent and irreversible."
msgstr ""
"Si voleu, podeu esborrar el vostre compte a Speedy Net. Si suprimiu el "
"vostre compte de Speedy Net, també se suprimirà automàticament el vostre "
"compte de Speedy Match. Per suprimir el vostre compte de Speedy Net, inicieu"
" sessió a Speedy Net, desactiveu el vostre compte i feu clic a \"Suprimeix "
"el compte\" (al menú \"Edita el perfil\"). Ompliu les dades del formulari i "
"confirmeu. Tingueu en compte que no es pot recuperar un compte suprimit. La "
"supressió del compte és permanent i irreversible."

